13
01:26:40,000 --> 01:26:46,000
It was directed by Franc Roddam in his feature directing debut.

14
01:33:20,000 --> 01:33:26,000
Unlike the adaptation of Tommy, Quadrophenia is not a musical
film, and the band does not appear live in the film.

15
01:40:00,000 --> 01:40:06,000
The film, set in London in 1964, depicts a period of emotional turmoil in the life of Jimmy Cooper (Phil Daniels), a young mod who escapes
from his dead-end job as a postroom boy by dancing, partying, abusing Dexamyl, riding scooters and brawling with rockers.

16
01:46:40,000 --> 01:46:46,000
